WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.365
Longer classes now open as you level up, by your own level from the backend.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.260
At level one you have three classes open. Every other card says the level that opens

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:15.736
it.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.493
At level seven the level-five tier is open: thirty minute Tempo Paceline. Ten and

00:00:28.493 --> 00:00:30.028
twenty stay locked.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.194
At level eighteen only one class is left: the sixty minute ride with surges, at

00:00:41.194 --> 00:00:42.327
level twenty.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.113
A class your level opened goes straight to Class Start, on any device.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:04.437
On a phone the shelves stack in one column. From a tablet up, the cards sit side by

00:01:04.437 --> 00:01:05.043
side.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.964
What the tests prove: only four tiers are allowed, and each opens at its level.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.193
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:27.538 --> 00:01:32.050
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.721
every hill and interval.

00:01:34.066 --> 00:01:39.244
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:39.244 --> 00:01:44.692
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:44.692 --> 00:01:47.682
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:48.027 --> 00:01:50.520
A custom workout lives under Profile.
